# Button (part name Btn - `Button` is a muten primitive, so a part can't reuse that name) - shadcn's Nova button.
# Put the label (and an icon) in the slot; an Icon nudges on hover (trailing moves on, leading lifts, lone grows).
#   Btn(onClick: save) { Span "Guardar" }
#   Btn(variant: "outline", size: "sm", onClick: cancel) { Icon "lucide:x"  Span "Cancelar" }
#   Btn(size: "icon-sm", variant: "ghost", tone: "wait", onClick: due) { Icon "lucide:clock"  Indicator(tone: "wait") }
#   Btn(onClick: go) class("cx-fill") { Span "Marcar llegada"  Icon "lucide:chevron-right" }   - full width (a card's primary)
# variant: default | outline | secondary | ghost | destructive | link   (default: default)
# size: xs (24) | sm (28) | default (32) | lg (36) | icon | icon-xs | icon-sm | icon-lg   (default: default)
# tone: "" | info | ok | wait | bad | note - a tinted icon button (a pending thing on a card)
# label: the name of an icon-only button (aria-label, and the kit's tooltip on hover). Leave it empty when there is text.
# shadcn-for-muten · part · no deps · Nova classes (nova.css) + kit.css.
part Btn(variant: text = "default", size: text = "default", tone: text = "", label: text = "", onClick: action) {
  Button -> $onClick class("cn-button cn-button-variant-{$variant} cn-button-size-{$size} group/button", "cx-tonal cx-has-indicator" when $tone != "") data(slot: "button", tone: $tone, name: $label) aria(label: $label) { slot }
}
# TriggerBtn - a Btn that only opens what sits next to it (a Popover, a DropdownMenu, a SplitButton's menu): it has no
# action of its own, so opening never runs something else. Same variants and sizes as Btn.
#   DropdownMenu { DropdownTrigger { TriggerBtn { Span "Opciones"  Icon "lucide:chevron-down" } }  DropdownContent { … } }
part TriggerBtn(variant: text = "outline", size: text = "default", label: text = "") {
  Button class("cn-button cn-button-variant-{$variant} cn-button-size-{$size} group/button") data(slot: "button", name: $label) aria(label: $label) { slot }
}
